WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.730
The monster that destroys 
this card is destroyed?

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:15.010
And it deals damage equal 
to its attack points.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.200
What’s happening?

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:29.490
That’s the condor geoglyph.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:30.900
Yusei!

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.610
I brought Jack!

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:34.610
Jack!  Crow!

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:38.050
What’s that?

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:40.320
So you’re Aki Izayoi.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.880
It looks like you won your 
duel, but what's that?

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.120
An earthquake?

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:47.460
It's...

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:51.490
What’s that?

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:52.910
What now?

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:55.400
That’s the direction of the old Moment.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:59.110
Did the gates to the underworld open?

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:53.280
Is that really...

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:11.700
Looking over a vast distance

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:16.800
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:21.710
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:26.470
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:31.840
No matter how bad today is

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:36.820
There's still the faintest light

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:42.230
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:46.290
Is light it myself

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:51.300
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:56.270
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:56.770 --> 00:03:02.570
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:06.550
Today will never exist again

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:12.450
So I won't stop or vanish

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:41.620
Final Fight!
The Man with Two Gods

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:54.550
That black mass is heading towards 
the lights from the City.

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:57.390
Yusei, Rutger said that the king of the

00:03:57.390 --> 00:04:00.790
underworld would appear if we failed to seal the four towers.

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:03.490
That’s the king of the underworld…

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:06.250
So it's the end of the world?

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:08.950
We're going to be trapped inside 
the darkness of the underworld?

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:13.500
But we’re still here!  That means 
we’re not completely trapped inside!

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:15.130
You’re right, but…

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:16.990
Ruka?

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:19.160
Kuribon!

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:26.880
Oh no!  Kuribon says that we can’t let 
it head towards the light of the condor!

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:28.880
What do you mean?

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:38.040
We can’t let it get there!

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:41.430
But how can we stop something that big?

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:46.480
The mark...

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:53.680
That’s…

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:55.270
Crimson Dragon.

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:07.280
We’re inside the Crimson Dragon.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.480
What's it planning to do with us?

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:19.830
What’s going on?

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:23.330
That’s the temple underneath 
Godwin’s mansion!

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:26.800
Is this the source of the light 
that we saw from Satellite?

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:31.280
Did we instantly teleport 
from Satellite to the City?

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:32.170
It seems so.

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:34.850
I’ve been waiting for you, Signers.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:39.760
You’ve defeated the Dark Signers.

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:43.660
However, you failed to close 
the gates to the underworld.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:45.360
Director?

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:47.100
Godwin!

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:51.440
Godwin, tell me!   Did we lose?

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:52.850
Is this world-

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:53.990
It's coming to an end.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:56.220
What?

00:05:57.400 --> 00:06:02.420
The king of the underworld 
is heading this way.

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:05.610
Why is the king of the 
underworld heading this way?

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:09.880
Because this temple is a 
sacred land for rituals.

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:11.350
Rituals?

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:17.320
That’s right.  In order to perform the 
ritual, I used the Crimson Dragon to bring you here.

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:23.490
It hurts!

00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:29.330
That’s the final mark.  The dragon head.

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:36.270
Is that your arm?

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:41.010
No.  This dragon head belongs 
to my older brother Rutger.

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:43.510
Why do you have it?

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:50.290
That mark!

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:52.530
You can’t be…

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:06.040
That’s right.  I became a Dark Signer!

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:07.100
What?

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:08.040
No way!

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:09.240
It can’t be!

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:26.020
What's he doing?

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:34.920
Using Dark Signer powers, 
I'll make this arm mine.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.640
The Crimson Dragon's power is resisting.

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:46.580
It will take some time to make this mine.

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:49.280
Godwin!  What are you planning to do?

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.280
I’m going to become a god!

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:57.960
Crimson Dragon and the evil god!  By gaining 
both their powers, I'll become the ultimate god!

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:03.660
Everyone, run away!

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:32.090
Let's begin the ritual to welcome 
the king of the underworld!

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:37.620
The ceremony will be a Riding 
Duel on the condor geoglyph.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:46.690
I'll completely crush the Signers and 
sacrifice you to the king of the underworld!

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:47.940
Godwin, why?

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:53.290
You’re the one who asked for Yusei's 
help to defeat the Dark Signers!

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:58.740
What will you do?  The king of 
the underworld will arrive soon.

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:03.950
Godwin!  If we win this duel, what will 
happen to the king of the underworld?

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:10.430
It will vanish.  But I won’t 
let that happen because I'm god!

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:13.000
I accept this duel!

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.070
Godwin, I'll defeat you!

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:17.590
I’m also fighting!

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:24.040
I’m not a Signer, but I'll do 
anything for the kids in Satellite!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:30.020
This may be reckless, but it’ll be just 
like when the legendary D-Wheeler flew!

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:36.590
Let’s battle, Godwin!

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:40.000
We three will stop the king of 
the underworld's resurrection!

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:50.020
Yusei!  Jack!  Crow!

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.080
Do your best!

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.840
We’re counting on you!

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:54.510
Master Atlas!

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:55.810
Yusei…

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:01.750
It’s a special 3-on-1 duel.

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:05.220
You will each start with 4000 life points.

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:09.190
I'll have three times that 
amount for 12000 life points.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:12.290
None of us can attack on the first turn.

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:14.560
Do you have any objections?

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:15.790
Nope!

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.230
This is our…

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:19.440
Final battle!

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:27.090
Duel!

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:50.940
The field will be Speed World.

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:56.600
Crow the Bullet will go first!

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:58.370
My turn!

00:10:58.370 --> 00:10:59.130
Here I go!

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:04.290
I summon the Tuner Monster Blackwing 
- Mistral the Silver Shield!

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:13.180
When a Blackwing is on my field, I 
can Special Summon this from my hand!

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:16.970
I Special Summon Blackwing 
– Bora the Spear!

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:21.130
I set once card and end my turn!

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:23.790
It's my turn!

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:29.150
I summon Mad Archfiend!

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:34.640
I set one card and end my turn!

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:36.930
My turn!

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:44.280
Godwin, why did you become a Dark Signer?

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:50.750
17 years ago, my brother Rutger 
released the power of the old Moment.

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:57.830
Right before that, he gave me 
his left arm, the dragon head.

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:02.610
Every 5000 years, Crimson Dragon 
battles against the evil god.

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:10.100
When it started again 17 years ago, they 
chose my brother’s body as the battleground.

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:13.610
Two marks entered my brother’s body – one

00:12:13.610 --> 00:12:16.610
for the Dark Signers and the other for the Signers.

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:22.530
The Dark Signer mark tried to 
take control of my brother.

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:27.820
The Dark Signer's power engulfed my brother.

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:33.670
My brother cut off his left arm 
that had the mark of the Signer.

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:38.970
He gave it to me so that the final 
battle would be left up to destiny.

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:41.640
Rex!

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:45.260
One day, people known as Signers will appear.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:49.630
No matter how many years it takes, 
gather them and defeat me!

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:51.650
What are you talking about, brother?

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:54.100
Do as I say, Rex!

00:12:54.720 --> 00:13:00.990
Two gods are inside my body.  However, 
I select the evil god's path.

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:06.200
Take it and escape while I still 
have control of my senses!

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:10.630
Then he released the power of the old Moment.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:16.600
I followed our brotherly destiny.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:20.350
I gathered the Signers and 
went to see my brother.

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:30.830
I came to a conclusion after seeing 
beyond the depths of destiny.

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:35.680
I lost against my brother.

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:52.640
You lost on purpose!  Why?

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.750
So that I can become you, brother.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:57.020
What do you mean?

00:13:57.660 --> 00:14:01.890
Brother, you can’t defeat Yusei Fudo.

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:04.100
Rex, what are you saying?

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:07.320
We can't change our destiny.

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:13.350
5000 years from now, there will be others 
who will have to carry the same burden as us.

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:18.740
The gods will use them, and their battle 
will harm the land and cover it in blood.

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:22.670
However, I will sever this chain!

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:25.440
How?

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:30.850
I’m going to do what you couldn't do.  
What you left for destiny to decide.

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:36.820
I’m going to overcome 
destiny by becoming a god!

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:38.120
What?

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:43.290
As I face death, I have a wish.

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:47.650
You gave me the mark of the Signer.

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:55.010
That left arm is mine, and I'll have 
two gods inside me, just like you!

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:56.190
Rex…

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:02.800
I’ll also become a Dark Signer.

00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:10.890
I’ll become a god and finish the battle 
between the Crimson Dragon and the evil god.

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:14.880
With the power of the king of the 
underworld, I will destroy this world.

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:19.010
Afterwards, I'll use the power of the 
Crimson Dragon to resurrect the world.

00:15:19.010 --> 00:15:22.250
I will create the world!

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.800
Enough with your foolishness, Godwin!

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:31.130
Why do the Satellite kids and Martha have to 
disappear when they haven’t done anything wrong?

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:35.560
Jack Atlas won't listen to your fantasies!

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:37.180
You’re making a mistake!

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:40.410
The power of the gods won't defeat destiny!

00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:44.150
We win by fighting and battling together!

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:47.050
What keeps you going in a battle?

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:50.510
Our bond of friendship!

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.610
I summon Max Warrior!

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:06.810
I set one card and end my turn!

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:10.280
I'll show you the two gods!

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:12.250
My turn!

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:19.950
If there are monsters on your field but none on

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:24.950
my field, I can Special Summon Oracle of the Sun.

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:30.390
Then I summon the Tuner 
Monster Fire Ant Ascator!

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:35.640
A Tuner Monster!

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:36.620
It’s coming!

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:43.150
Level 3 Fire Ant Ascator tunes 
Level 5 Oracle of the Sun!

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:50.690
When the sun rises, all darkness 
is illuminated!  Rain down light!

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:53.300
Synchro Summon!

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:56.640
Come, Sun Dragon Inti!

00:16:57.220 --> 00:16:59.960
Is that his ace monster?

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:03.990
By removing the Tuner Monster Fire Ant Ascator in

00:17:03.990 --> 00:17:08.290
my graveyard from play, I Special Summon Weeping Idol.

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:14.550
Then I lower my life points by 1000 to Special

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:19.050
Summon the Dark Tuner Dark Goddess Witaka from my hand.

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:24.310
I activate Dark Goddess Witaka’s effect!

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:29.940
The Level of this card can be the same as 
the Level of a Synchro Monster on the field.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:36.300
Sun Dragon Inti is Level 8.  Therefore, Dark 
Goddess Witaka’s Level also becomes 8!

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:43.950
Level 8 Dark Goddess Witaka dark 
tunes Level 2 Weeping Idol!

00:17:49.350 --> 00:17:55.810
When the moon fills the darkness, the evil 
roar emanates!  Invite them to death!

00:17:55.810 --> 00:17:57.570
Dark Synchro!

00:17:57.570 --> 00:18:00.190
Come, Moon Dragon Quilla!

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:04.910
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:10.530
Due to Moon Dragon Quilla’s effect, 
it's destroyed at the End Phase.

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:14.200
For such a grandiose entrance, 
it’s already leaving.

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:16.830
I don’t care about gods or destiny.

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:21.680
I’m going to soar above it all, 
just like the legendary D-Wheeler!

00:18:22.610 --> 00:18:26.660
But that cost him his left arm.

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.230
What is he talking about?

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:31.140
My turn!

00:18:32.680 --> 00:18:36.030
I activate the Speed Spell - Tune Up 123!

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:39.130
I roll a die, and Mistral the Silver

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:42.430
Shield’s Level increases depending on the number I roll!

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:49.270
Mistral the Silver Shield’s 
Level increases by 1!

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:53.940
Mistral the Silver Shield 
tunes Bora the Spear!

00:18:56.260 --> 00:19:00.400
Black wind, turn into wings 
that rise to the heavens!

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:03.720
Synchro Summon!

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:06.790
Blackwing Armor Master!

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:11.230
When a Blackwing is faceup on my field, I can

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:14.930
summon this monster without releasing another monster!

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:19.560
I Normal Summon Level 5 Blackwing 
– Elphin the Raven!

00:19:20.940 --> 00:19:24.410
Armor Master attacks Sun Dragon Inti!

00:19:25.150 --> 00:19:27.010
Black Hurricane!

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:32.400
You’re attacking with a monster 
with fewer attack points?

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:47.980
Armor Master can't be destroyed in battle, 
and battle damage also becomes 0!

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:53.520
Armor Master puts a Wedge Counter 
in the monster that it attacked!

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:59.440
By removing the wedge, your monster’s 
attack and defense points become zero this turn!

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:03.060
Elphin the Raven attacks Sun Dragon Inti!

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:16.370
You can't oppose the sun, much less a god.

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:23.170
The legendary D-Wheeler learned that 
lesson when he lost his left arm.

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:25.600
What's he talking about?

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:28.770
Can it be?  Is he the legendary D-Wheeler?

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:29.520
What?

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:31.610
There’s no way that’s true!

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:36.430
The monster that destroyed Sun Dragon Inti is also

00:20:36.430 --> 00:20:40.830
destroyed, and you take damage equal to its attack points.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:51.860
When Sun Dragon Inti is destroyed, I can 
Special Summon Moon Dragon Quilla from my graveyard.

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:58.520
The legendary D-Wheeler learned that 
it's impossible to oppose destiny.

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:03.680
That's because humans are 
mediocre and pathetic.

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:08.010
In order to change destiny, you must 
surpass humanity and become a god!

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:11.390
Only then can miracles occur!

00:21:11.390 --> 00:21:16.350
I'll never believe that!  I won’t 
let you dishonor our important legend!

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:24.480
What?

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:25.360
What's this?

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:26.210
The mark…

00:21:26.210 --> 00:21:27.250
Vanished.

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:37.390
What?  Godwin has all the marks!

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:47.110
I'm the ultimate god!

00:21:58.010 --> 00:22:02.480
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:07.550
We will build our own future

00:22:08.020 --> 00:22:12.990
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:13.450 --> 00:22:18.160
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:23.760 --> 00:22:33.300
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:33.730 --> 00:22:38.870
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.940 --> 00:22:43.580
Even if it loses its light

00:22:44.050 --> 00:22:48.850
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:48.850 --> 00:22:53.320
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:53.520 --> 00:22:58.900
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:59.030 --> 00:23:03.780
This journey has no end

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:09.240
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:14.480
Hear my voice
